 174.4 C239.4 158.5 267.9 140.8 296.4 124.0 C324.8 107.2 353.3 76.4 381.8 73.6 C410.3 70.8 438.8 93.2 467.3 107.2 C495.8 121.2 524.2 160.4 552.7 157.6 C581.2 154.8 609.7 107.2 638.2 90.4 C666.7 73.6 695.2 50.3 723.6 56.8 C752.1 63.3 780.6 106.3 809.1 129.6 C837.6 152.9 866.1 180.9 894.5 196.8 C923.0 212.7 965.8 220.1 980.0 224.8\"/>\n        <text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"40\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">J</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"125.45454545455\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">F</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"210.90909090909\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"296.36363636364\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"381.81818181818\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"467.27272727273\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">J</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"552.72727272727\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">J</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"638.18181818182\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"723.63636363636\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">S</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"809.09090909091\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">O</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"894.54545454545\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">N</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"980\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">D</text>      </svg>\n      <figcaption>Illustrative workload over a year. ENGISOFT capacity follows the programme: up for peaks, bids and deadlines, down after handover.</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n      </div>\n</section>\n\t<section class=\"bone pad\"><div class=\"wrap faqx\"><div><p class=\"lab\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Questions about <em>bim resource outsourcing.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Anything else? <a class=\"u\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask ENGISOFT.</a></p></div><div class=\"qa\"><details><summary>How is outsourcing different from staff augmentation?<i></i></summary><p>Outsourcing is an ongoing supply of resources under one service contract that ENGISOFT administers. Augmentation adds specific skills for a defined peak or gap.</p></details><details><summary>How is it different from a dedicated team?<i></i></summary><p>With outsourcing you manage the individual professionals. A dedicated team comes with its own ENGISOFT BIM lead who manages the team and its internal QA.</p></details><details><summary>What does the rate include?<i></i></summary><p>One agreed rate covers the professional, sourcing, assessment, onboarding and replacement support, so you pay for productive hours: no recruitment fees, no bench cost between projects and no restart if someone leaves.</p></details><details><summary>Who handles HR and administration?<i></i></summary><p>ENGISOFT handles payroll, compliance and onboarding for outsourced professionals; the exact terms are set out in the proposal.</p></details></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Other models</p><h2 class=\"h2\">More ways <em>to staff a project.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/bim-staffing/\">All BIM staffing <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/onsite/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Onsite BIM Staffing</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/remote/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Remote BIM Staffing</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/dedicated-teams/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Dedicated BIM Teams</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/staff-augmentation/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Staff Augmentation</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/mobilization/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Workforce Mobilization</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/workforce-continuity/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Workforce Continuity</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/temporary/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Temporary BIM Staffing</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/long-term/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Long-Term BIM Staffing</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/technical-recruitment/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Technical Recruitment</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n","cta":"<img class=\"bg\" srcset=\"/assets/img/team-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/team.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/assets/img/team.jpg\" alt=\"ENGISOFT engineers reviewing a project together\" loading=\"lazy\">    <p class=\"lab\">Next step</p><h2 class=\"display\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Request BIM <em>professionals.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/request-talent/\">Request BIM professionals <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"tel:+971588672901\">+971 58 867 2901</a></div>"}